name: "Delivery Improvement Process Issue"
description: "Submit a delivery-related process issue to support improvement initiatives."
title: "[TITLE] - [Short Description]"
labels: [process-improvement, triage]
assignees: []

body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ## Delivery Improvement Process Issue Form
        Please fill out the form below to report a delivery-related process issue. Fields marked with * are required.

  - type: input
    id: issue_title
    attributes:
      label: Issue Title
      description: Provide a concise, descriptive title that clearly identifies the process issue.
      placeholder: "Example: Delays in client onboarding handoff"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: issue_type
    attributes:
      label: Issue Type
      options:
        - Bottleneck
        - Communication Gap
        - Handoff Problem
        - Resource Allocation
        - Time Management
        - Quality Control
        - Documentation Issue
        - Training Need
        - Compliance/Regulatory
        - Other
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: priority
    attributes:
      label: Priority
      options:
        - Critical (Blocking deliveries, causing immediate business impact)
        - High (Significantly impacting efficiency, quality, or timelines)
        - Medium (Noticeably affecting processes but with workarounds available)
        - Low (Minor inconvenience or optimization opportunity)
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: current_process
    attributes:
      label: Current Process Description
      description: Describe the current process that needs improvement. Be specific about how it currently works.
      placeholder: "Include the main steps, responsible teams, and tools involved."

  - type: textarea
    id: issue_description
    attributes:
      label: Issue Description
      description: >
        Provide a detailed description of the problem, including:
        - When and where it occurs in the delivery process
        - How often it happens
        - Who it affects
        - Quantifiable impact (e.g., delays, errors, cost)
        - Any temporary workarounds
      placeholder: "Describe the issue context and consequences in detail."

  - type: textarea
    id: root_cause
    attributes:
      label: Root Cause Analysis (Optional)
      description: List any potential root causes if known. Can be refined after investigation.
      placeholder: |
        1. 
        2. 
        3. 

  - type: textarea
    id: business_impact
    attributes:
      label: Business Impact
      description: >
        Describe the impact on delivery timelines, customer satisfaction, team productivity, quality, costs, or compliance.
        Include metrics if possible.
      placeholder: "E.g., Delays of 3+ days per handoff, 2 FTEs needed for rework, customer churn risk..."

  - type: textarea
    id: proposed_solution
    attributes:
      label: Proposed Solution(s)
      description: Suggest one or more possible solutions. Include pros and cons if applicable.
      placeholder: "E.g., Introduce a pre-handoff checklist to reduce back-and-forth."

  - type: textarea
    id: success_metrics
    attributes:
      label: Success Metrics
      description: How will we measure success? List specific, quantifiable indicators of improvement.
      placeholder: "E.g., Reduce delivery time by 20%, increase satisfaction rating to 4.5/5, eliminate rework steps"

  - type: textarea
    id: stakeholders
    attributes:
      label: Stakeholders
      description: List key people involved or impacted.
      placeholder: |
        - Process Owner: [Name or Role]
        - Affected Teams: [List]
        - Decision Makers: [Approvers]
        - Subject Matter Experts: [Consulted roles]

  - type: textarea
    id: related_docs
    attributes:
      label: Related Documentation
      description: Add links to any related SOPs, prior tickets, diagrams, or documentation.

  - type: input
    id: date_identified
    attributes:
      label: Issue Identified Date
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"

  - type: input
    id: investigation_deadline
    attributes:
      label: Investigation Deadline
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"

  - type: input
    id: solution_proposal_deadline
    attributes:
      label: Solution Proposal Deadline
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"

  - type: input
    id: implementation_target
    attributes:
      label: Implementation Target Date
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"

  - type: input
    id: review_date
    attributes:
      label: Review Date
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"

  - type: textarea
    id: notes_updates
    attributes:
      label: Notes & Updates
      description: Keep a chronological log of discoveries, discussions, and decisions.
